          <span class="num">CC BY 4.0</span> so that somebody else may implement and reprint it;
          and the typefaces this page is set in are <span class="num">SIL OFL 1.1</span>. All of
          it is in the
          <a href="https://github.com/JonasGrunau/open_audio_analyzer" rel="noopener">repository</a>,
